Output raven-object-display-validationrules.gif

Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set Padding 24
Set Framerate 30
Set TypingSpeed 25ms
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Hide
Type "export PS1='$ '"
Enter
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "sf raven object display validationrules --target-org trailhead --sobject Bird__c"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 5s
